WEBVTT

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.280
Is the idea here that you can 
beat me by working together?

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:21.700
Hayato!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.250
I'm gonna chew you up now!

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.790
Let go of Hayato!

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:28.540
Hey, whoa! Hold up! T-Time out!

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.170
Wait, can you not see in front of you?

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:34.090
Then even I can handle this!

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:40.440
<i>Huh? That worked really well for some reason.</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:54.600
<b><i>The Idaten Deities
</i>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hKnow Only Peace</b>

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:10.980
<b><i>The Idaten Deities
</i>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hKnow Only Peace</b>

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:17.440
Wh-What is wrong with you?!

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:19.740
No one cares!

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:20.940
Now die!

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.700
Looks like a pretty even fight.

00:02:28.190 --> 00:02:30.290
Now then, my demon friend...

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:33.780
You know how you're not supposed 
to look at the sun with a telescope

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.460
or a magnifying glass?

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:40.050
I never did understand <i>why</i> they say that.

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:45.100
Damn it, of all the stupid tricks...

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:48.820
<i>The flash grenade seems effective enough.</i>

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:51.600
<i>She's blocked off the exit...</i>

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:56.150
Now then, it's going to take a second
 for you to recover your vision...

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.150
Why don't we chat a bit?

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:02.840
General Piscalat, you're rather sharp.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:05.200
The fact that you were thorough enough

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.940
to lure a weak opponent like me
into such a vulnerable position...

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:12.750
It's proof of how well you 
understand the position you're in.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:17.840
You appreciate that demonkind has next 
to no chance of winning this conflict.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:21.210
I know what your goal is.

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:24.620
You intend to eliminate the three 
of us, who are still immature,

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:27.120
and then figure out a way
 to deal with Rin-san

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.090
once you've taken appropriate precautions.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:30.500
Does that about cover it?

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:35.230
Speculate about dream scenarios all you want,

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:39.360
but you're all going to die today.
 It's that simple.

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:42.360
I'll concede that my death
 isn't out of the question.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.440
But the demons you sent after my friends

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.530
will all die by Prontea-san's hand.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:08.040
That's your full power, then?

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:11.450
I think I've gotten a good grasp of it.

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.830
And now it's my turn!

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:23.940
In the end, it seems straight-up punching 
them is the most powerful after all.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:29.870
Rin-san isn't the only Idaten 
capable of defeating demons.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:32.910
I'm afraid you all are the ones 
speculating about dream scenarios.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.530
You don't seem to realize that 
demons only posed a threat before

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:40.460
because tens of thousands of you
went on a mindless, frenzied rampage.

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.680
I don't see your point.

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:45.360
And whatever it is,
 you're still going to die.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.490
<i>Idiot. Keep running your mouth.</i>

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:50.740
Are you sure about that?

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:54.360
If I can escape from this room, 
I can contact Prontea-san.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.520
That will ensure <i>you</i> die.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:01.230
<i>I'm sure it would. 
Just keep talking, scum.</i>

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:07.160
There's one other thing to consider:
intelligence can sometimes be a hindrance.

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.290
<i>He can't be stupid enough 
to think that'll work again!</i>

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:20.960
What were you trying to do? 
Did you really think that would damage me?

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:25.530
I guess not. All I could manage 
was to rip your clothes.

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:29.350
And I have to say, you have a fantastic rack.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.760
Y-Y-Y-You bastard!

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:38.830
This is what I meant. You've restricted 
your movements, and for what?

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.270
Some asinine notion of embarrassment?

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.910
I'm fairly certain that 
demonkind's primary objective

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:45.510
is to find a way to propagate the species,

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:46.900
which made me realize something.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:50.860
Your elevated intelligence has resulted 
in an elevated sense of pride,

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:52.410
leading you astray
 from the goal of reproduction

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.510
and giving rise to shame 
at being stripped naked...

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:58.170
Why, you're acting like 
a sweet little virgin.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:01.460
<i>Y-You... You piece of shit!</i>

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.960
<i>You're dead! I'm going to kill you!</i>

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.650
<i>I swear I'll kill you!</i>

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:08.130
Die!

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:10.390
What?!

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:14.110
I'm afraid that trick won't work.

00:06:14.110 --> 00:06:18.390
The first demon that came 
after us already tried it.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:20.340
Nickel...

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.030
Damn! What is he up to now?

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:32.430
<i>What is this? He's just standing there?
 And not doing anything?</i>

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.430
<i>What's his game?</i>

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:40.420
<i>Poison?!</i>

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:46.120
<i>Don't tell me this is why he was rambling 
all entire time?! But what's the point?</i>

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.110
<i>Poison doesn't have any effect on...</i>

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:52.730
In pure demons,

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:55.100
no substance causes a
physiological reaction this quickly.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:59.150
But... you all have human brains.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.540
And while the human brain can 
resist pain to some degree,

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.330
it has no real defense against pleasure.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:10.590
Yes, this is a highly potent 
narcotic and aphrodisiac cocktail.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:15.700
If you had simply struck without hesitation 
at the start, you could've killed me.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.850
But that streak of intelligence you have

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:20.990
inspired fear of the risks involved,
 hesitation, and failure.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.280
I guess you're not listening anymore.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:33.640
<i>The enemy can't overcome Hayato's 
defenses and regenerative speed...</i>

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:37.100
<i>But Hayato's own attack power is lacking, eh?</i>

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:37.640
Holy shit, you are gross-looking!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.450
<i>At this rate, Hayato-kun 
will win within a few hours.</i>

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:44.350
<i>But that'd be a bit too dull.</i>

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:47.350
<i>Let's try one last experiment.</i>

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.640
<i>Paula, can you hear me?</i>

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.160
Prontea-san?

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:57.580
<i>Try fighting with that sword.</i>

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:02.850
It's the same as what Master uses, 
but I can actually separate mine from my hand.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:06.840
Think of it as me lending you my strength.

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.170
O-Okay!

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:27.230
It's like a character at the start 
of the game getting end-game gear!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:30.110
<i>Paula, give it to Hayato.</i>

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.480
Here, Hayato.

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:32.210
Okay...

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:33.740
Wh-Whoa!

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:38.200
Whoa, wait a sec! 
I give up! I surrender! So stop!

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.810
I'm begging you, just don't kill me—

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.470
Winning wouldn't feel right
if I had to use that to do it.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:51.420
Bring it. Let's settle this the normal way.

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:58.190
So he's truly interested in getting stronger
 without using any cheats, huh?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:03.600
What... are you going to do with me?

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.850
Well, since I did manage 
to capture you alive,

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.860
I have a few things in mind 
that I'm bound to enjoy.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:15.280
Don't! Just... kill me instead.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:19.390
I get the feeling you're imagining something 
lascivious, but you don't need to worry.

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:23.290
Although you might have 
preferred that, considering...

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:25.710
I'm a scientist.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.730
The bed I fool around on 
is of a surgical nature.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.250
The only insertions I make 
involve sharpened scalpels.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.810
Because I came into existence naturally,

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:37.010
I didn't understand my nature 
until I met Hayato...

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:41.560
And before that happened, I dissected

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:45.230
an innumerable number of humans 
to understand what I was.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:49.060
I've got a knack for tweaking 
the human brain, you see.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:52.960
<b>#5
Color</b>

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:59.260
First fleet is reporting 
no changes with the target!

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:01.120
What do you think, Brandy?

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:01.740
Second fleet is reporting 
no changes with the target!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:05.330
She's not budging, that's for sure. 
It's getting boring to watch.

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:04.560
Third fleet is reporting 
no changes with the target!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.820
Maybe I'll have Miku take a look instead.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:10.170
Miku?

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:17.300
Wow, you're still looking feisty after 
what those soldiers did to you, huh?

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.670
I will not be shamed into submission!

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:22.510
But you people need to stop 
this travesty before—

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.270
What are you... Stop it!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.870
I can tell you won't submit to violence.

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.870
You've got a strong heart, 
one that held up in spite

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:33.980
of how you were humiliated for days on end.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:37.690
But I'm pretty sure that 
twice yesterday... you know?

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.110
N-No!

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.580
You're afraid...

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:47.120
Deathly afraid ever since you 
felt the first twinge of pleasure!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.790
You're scared that even though you can 
withstand any amount of suffering,

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:54.880
ecstasy might be what finally 
gets you to give in!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:58.610
Stop it! Just stop!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.610
Okay. I will.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.010
I stopped.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:07.220
"You didn't have to stop right away."

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:07.220
<i>You didn't have to stop right away...</i>

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:12.410
<i>Y-You're wrong!</i>

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.180
Miku, could you come with me
 to the monitor room?

00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:21.070
Brandy? C'mon, things were
 finally getting good.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.270
What about her training?

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:26.550
I was going to have her eyes rolling around 
in her head from consecutive climaxes!

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:29.410
Well, your plans are canceled, 
so get a move on!

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:31.450
'Kay...

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:35.380
You were lucky this time.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.130
Empress Brandy!

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:40.880
Your nation treats people like toys!

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.140
You will suffer divine punishment for this!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.270
Have you no fear of God?!

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:51.150
God, huh? That's certainly a scary prospect.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.960
I wasn't expecting them to be on that level.

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:59.030
What exactly do you mean...?

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.390
Good question.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:05.780
If you really think you serve a god, 
maybe you should ask one yourself?

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:24.430
Already worn out? Looks like I win, then.

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.680
Damn it...

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.130
Six hours, huh? That was 
faster than I expected.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.060
Okay, got it.

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:36.060
Welcome, Neput, Cory.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:39.450
The two of you will also 
be undergoing Ysley-sama's

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:42.570
wonderful brainwashing surgery to join me!

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:44.320
<b>Surgery</b>

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.660
Somebody help!

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:50.060
No! Don't touch me! Not there!

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:51.700
<b>Demon Trio</b>

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.700
<b>ELIMINATED</b>

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.810
No changes on any of the monitors.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:57.710
<b>Rookie Seaman
Pete (Human)</b>

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:57.710
The target hasn't moved.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.600
Hi! You called?

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:03.140
Miku, what's your take on this situation?

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:07.550
I'm glad you asked! It's nice to have 
a couple of young ones around, y'know?

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.510
How old are you, anyway?

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.220
Hey!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.590
Let me ask you again.
What do you think, Miku?

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:20.100
I'll need to watch a bit longer.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:23.820
<i>I'm amazed she can screw around like 
that in front of the emperor...</i>

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:26.080
<i>But why did they bring in the trainer?</i>

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:30.280
Okay, they're ready!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.620
A-Are they going to be okay?

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.570
Oh, they'll settle down in a bit. 
Don't you worry.

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:41.820
So, why don't you tell us all about

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:45.130
the remaining demons and 
what they're doing in Zoble?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.410
Right. Very well.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.380
There are 359 of us left.

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:49.590
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:50.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:51.570
Among them, only three pose an actual threat:

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:51.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:54.050
Empress Brandy, Emperor Takeshita,
 and Umeyo the midwife.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:52.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:53.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:55.740
The three of them are stronger 
than Neput or myself.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:54.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:55.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:56.850
Brandy is particularly powerful.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:56.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:57.530
Umeyo is dangerous

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:57.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:57.530 --> 00:13:59.520
because she can act as an
 incubator for newly born demons.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:13:58.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:59.120 --> 00:13:59.600
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.360
She can also take in humans.

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:00.610
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.630
The human and demon then fuse within her,

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:01.610
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:02.670
creating a demon with a human's 
form and intelligence.

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:02.610
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.710
The reason Zoble abducts 
and reeducates women is to that end.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:03.610
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:06.140
Soldiers were simply allowed 
to assault women at first,

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:05.610
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:06.610
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:07.730
but that often resulted in women
 being killed, or killing themselves,

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:07.610
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:09.380
afterward instead of having children.
 It thus served no purpose.

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:08.610
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:09.610
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:11.200
Now that kind of thing is only 
allowed on active battlefields.

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:10.620
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:11.620
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.660
So much that soldiers who 
volunteer for front-line duty

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:12.620
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.120
typically do so with that in mind...

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:13.640
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:17.610
What's wrong?

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:23.770
Er, I just thought you'd be
a bit disgusted after hearing that...

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:25.590
But you don't seem to mind at all.

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:28.620
I thought the Idaten were 
supposed to protect humans.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.980
Well, we're on their side,

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:36.100
but we're also pretty ambivalent when it 
comes to their notions of rights and ethics.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.810
Doesn't that mean you've won, though?

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.310
Couldn't Long-Locks here

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:45.610
and that monster on the island team up
 and just kill everyone in Zoble?

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.490
No, destroying Zoble 
without some sort of plan

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.570
could throw human society into chaos.

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:53.580
A war between Hotaena and 
Sarabael would be trouble.

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:58.040
Regardless, I'll manage something 
as far as the humans go.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:02.650
I want the three of you to 
act as though you've killed us

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.130
and return to Zoble as spies.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:06.570
I'm afraid that won't work.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:11.140
Why not? They tell you 
to bring back our bodies?

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:12.980
There is that...

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.760
But the main issue is that 
Miku is still in Zoble.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.170
She's a threat of a different variety.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:24.330
Hey, could you have the sixth fleet move
 15 kilometers back from the coast?

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.530
And then have the first through 
fifth fleets move closer by two clicks?

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.030
Miku, what's that going to accomplish?

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.530
Well, it's just a guess at this point, but...

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:39.040
I think she'll unfold her arms 
and switch up her stance a little.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:43.120
<i>What the heck? I don't get it.</i>

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.840
Miku? Who's that?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.470
Is she strong?

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:49.150
Not exactly, no.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:52.880
She's normally in charge of reeducating 
the women we capture.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:56.110
I'm pretty sure even the girl 
with the pigtails could beat her.

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.140
Me?

00:15:57.590 --> 00:15:59.240
I should start at the beginning...

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:00.390
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:00.980
The way we fuse humans and demons

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:01.390
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.870
involves taking an infant of each species 
species and letting them combine.

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:02.390
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:03.400
It's mostly hand-off.

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:03.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.900
This results in wildly varying mutations,

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:04.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.200
both in terms of form and power.

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:05.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:06.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:07.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:08.580
Miku and Barcode were created after

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:08.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.780
an effort was made to remove the 
randomness from the process.

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:09.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:10.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:11.980
It was ultimately a failure, though,

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:11.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:12.400
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:13.720
as they're severely lacking in 
both strength and shapeshifting ability.

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:13.410
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:14.910
But it wasn't a total loss.

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:14.410
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:16.640
As a side effect, they have 
remarkable nervous systems.

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:15.410
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:16.410
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:18.160
Barcode can process 
incredible amounts of information,

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:17.410
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:18.410
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.660
and Miku has an abnormal level 
of observational insight.

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:19.410
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:20.430
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.340
See, she moved just like I thought!

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:34.340
She'll notice that our brains were 
tampered with as soon as she sees us.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.920
She did, but I'm not sure why.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.900
And what was the point?

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:42.140
Let's see... How about 
we discuss this outside?

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.280
See, she'd taken up a position

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:49.760
that would let her wipe out the 
entire fleet in an instant.

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:52.780
That's why I had them switch to 
a formation that would make it harder

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:54.450
for her to eliminate them where she stood.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:57.660
But don't you think it's funny, Your Majesty?

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:00.160
No, I'm not sure I understand.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.970
Well, if she doesn't want to kill humans,

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:06.090
couldn't she just run away instead 
of getting ready to attack?

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:08.200
Why would she stand her ground like that?

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:10.170
There's only one reason.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:14.660
There must be something there
that she wants to keep safe.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:18.600
I wonder what it could be...

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.520
How's it going? Any new developments?

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:26.870
Oh, Your Lordship! 
Are you feeling any better?

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:29.600
Yes, I just finished repairs a minute ago.

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:33.990
That stupid brat just had to smash my body...

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:38.240
She's protecting something, is she?

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:41.620
I'd wager it's the seal keeping 
the old demons at bay.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.870
The old demons are sealed away?

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:48.790
Eight hundred years ago,
all of demonkind were trapped behind a seal.

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:53.080
If we can break that seal, 
wouldn't the tables turn instantly?

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:54.840
Is that what you're thinking, Miku?

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.250
Not at all!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:18:00.100
Y'know, Your Majesty, you're a good study,
 but you're not too clever.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:04.020
There are three problems.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:08.650
"Problem 1"

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:08.650
Firstly, we don't know how to break the seal.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:12.000
How do we destroy the island 
with Rin defending it?

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:14.650
"Problem 2"

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:14.650
I'm not sure we have the means to do so.

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:17.750
Those are good points...

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:23.350
The return of the wild, unintelligent demons

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:27.680
"Problem 3"

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:26.430
would be as much of an issue for us
as it would the Idaten.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:30.000
They can't differentiate friend and foe.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.120
True enough.

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:36.760
Knowing the location of the 
seal is interesting, however.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.980
I thought we were onto something...

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.850
But I guess we'll have to 
think of something else.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:47.440
How do we destroy the island 
with Rin defending it?

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:48.970
<i>"Rin"?</i>

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:54.690
<i>How does the Demon Lord 
know that Idaten's name?</i>

00:18:56.470 --> 00:19:00.610
Who exactly is this doctor... 
this Demon Lord Over-M?

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:02.530
The Demon Lord...

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:03.660
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:04.640
He was the one who granted us 
human forms and intelligence,

00:19:04.180 --> 00:19:04.660
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.240
and he's maneuvering to 
take control of society.

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:05.660
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:06.660
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.180
But because he always contacts 
us via android proxies,

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:07.660
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:08.660
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:09.290
we're not completely certain 
about his identity.

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:09.660
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.170
Seventy years ago, 
when Takeshita and I were kids,

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:10.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.170
the Demon Lord seemed to rule 
over Zoble as Emperor Obama.

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:11.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:12.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.320
We all had to wonder if

00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:13.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:14.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:17.550
he was actually just a human using
 us demons for world conquest.

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:15.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:16.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:17.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.480
But one day, after he'd reached 
an age most humans would be dead at,

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:18.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:19.670
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:21.390
he abdicated the throne to Takeshita 
and faked his own death

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:20.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:21.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.300
before returning as a scientist named 
Obami that worked in military R&D.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:22.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:23.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:25.320
He said it was so that he could dedicate 
more time to the prosperity of demons,

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:24.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:25.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:26.140
but the job would take over a century.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.060
If he were human, he'd never live that long.

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:26.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:27.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.200
There <i>is</i> a possibility 
the person controlling

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:28.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:29.680
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.430
the android may have changed at some point,

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:30.690
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:31.730
but even if there's an 
organized effort behind it,

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:31.690
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.800
I can't imagine why humans 
would expend multiple lifetimes

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:33.690
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:34.690
devoted to helping demonkind.

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:34.690
<b>Fast Forward Explanation in Progress</b>

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:37.280
Hang on a second, maybe he's...

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.190
No, it can't be...

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:43.650
<i>If the Demon Lord is a human, 
his lifespan doesn't make any sense.</i>

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:48.730
<i>But if he's a pure demon, then where 
does his intelligence come from?</i>

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:53.580
Maybe the Demon Lord is an Idaten?

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:58.380
Then why would he oppose the rest of you?

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:01.840
I-I dunno about the details, but...

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:05.760
Oh, you know how we're mostly 
made up of human thoughts?

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:09.330
The Demon Lord could be an Idaten who 
was created from the thoughts of demons!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.520
That'd explain everything, right?

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.230
I seriously doubt that.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:18.760
If he were an Idaten, he'd have to know 
more about us than he does, wouldn't he?

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.740
I think we've been at this for too long.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:24.740
Let's have a little break.

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:27.020
I'm down for that.

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:29.450
Actually, I kind of want to ditch altogether.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:31.860
Hey, man, let's train some more.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:35.710
Oh, I actually need to talk with Prontea-san.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:37.840
Could we address that first?

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.960
Yeah, all right.

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:43.770
Hey! What about my training?

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:46.930
No need to worry. 
I'll give you something to work on.

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:50.930
First, try to defeat these three.

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:54.310
Okay, then. Now that's my kind of homework.

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:55.790
General Piscalat.

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:57.060
Yes?

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:00.110
About the Demon Lord...

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:04.180
You're exactly right.

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:07.840
That wasn't like you, Ysley-kun.

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:11.290
Why call for a break when we 
haven't made any headway?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.500
Did you pick up on something?

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:18.430
Yes. I understand what's going on now.

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:21.710
This doctor that they call the Demon Lord...

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:24.230
I know who he really is.
